   "index": 0,
   "text": "render template \"/system/builder/llm/templates/propertiesUser.template\", write to %propertiesUserMsg%",
   "lineNumber": 12,
   "comment": "Stage 3 \u2014 write each step's actions: which of its menu, in what order, how many times, and with\nwhat property values.\n\nThis one IS an LLM call, not a decider question: order and property values are written, not\npicked from a closed set. One request for the whole goal, because the steps refer to each other \u2014\n`%!data%` means the action before it, and a model shown one step alone cannot see that.\n\nThe answer is in the .pr's own action shape, so the step reads it through the same door it reads\na built .pr through \u2014 nothing converts it on the way in.",
   "waitForExecution": true,
